WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.011 line:8%
Open the student's correct enrolment.

00:00:03.011 --> 00:00:09.033 line:8%
The instalment timeline separates original charges, adjustments, exemptions and payments.

00:00:10.048 --> 00:00:16.650 line:8%
Find Charge adjustments to read the amount, effective date and reason for each recorded change.

00:00:16.650 --> 00:00:19.291 line:8%
A negative adjustment reduces the charge.

00:00:20.305 --> 00:00:23.366 line:8%
Compare the net obligation and remaining balance.

00:00:23.366 --> 00:00:30.363 line:8%
Use the programme's fee-plan workflow for permitted fee changes; an adjustment is not a bank receipt.
